whimsy-help-doc-viewer-text = Markdown and CSV viewer: .md files read with reader typography and contents, CSV/TSV as a sortable table, Source toggle, live reload
whimsy-help-link-lasso-name = Link Lasso
whimsy-help-link-lasso-text = Link lasso: Option-drag a rectangle over links, let go, and they become a folder of unloaded tabs
whimsy-help-season-toast-name = Season Toast
whimsy-help-season-toast-text = New season toast: the first window in a new season shows the balloon in its costume, once
whimsy-help-selection-verbs-name = Selection Verbs
whimsy-help-selection-verbs-text = Cmd+K: actions for the selected text or page (Translate, Map, Calendar, Linear, Markdown, Notes, your skills)
whimsy-help-redact-name = Redact
whimsy-help-redact-text = Redact in screenshots: blur emails, phone numbers, keys and card numbers before capturing; click text to blur it
whimsy-help-capture-card-name = Capture Card
whimsy-help-capture-card-text = Screenshots: one viewer for every capture (Add to Easel, Copy, Download, Edit, Save and Close; one Library file per save) and an editor with backdrop, shape, hiding private details and redacting by hand
whimsy-help-space-look-name = Space Look
whimsy-help-space-look-text = A look per space: its own interface font, density, tab title lines and Zen Mod, switching with the space
whimsy-help-easel-name = Easel
whimsy-help-easel-text = Easel: a canvas of text, drawings, shapes, images, links and live captures, pinned like a tab (Arc Easels)
whimsy-help-command-registry-name = Command Registry
whimsy-help-command-registry-text = Every Whimsy action is a named command: in the command bar and under "Whimsy" in Settings → Keyboard Shortcuts, so any of them can take a shortcut
whimsy-help-arc-audio-icon-name = Arc Audio Icon
whimsy-help-arc-audio-icon-text = Arc's tab speaker: outline speaker beside the title on every tab with sound, struck through when muted; click mutes
whimsy-help-space-profiles-name = Space Profiles
whimsy-help-space-profiles-text = Profiles: each space belongs to a profile (a container) with its own cookies, passwords, history, Essentials, search engine, downloads and extensions, like Arc
whimsy-help-zap-name = Zap
whimsy-help-zap-text = Zap: erase page elements with Cmd+Shift+X, the command bar or the site panel; undo, space-colored dust
whimsy-help-link-hints-name = Link Hints
whimsy-help-link-hints-text = Link hints: Cmd+J puts letter badges on links and buttons; type one to click it, Shift for a new tab
whimsy-help-instant-result-name = Instant Result
whimsy-help-instant-result-text = Instant result: Shift+Enter on a search in the command bar opens the top result (Arc Max Instant Links)
whimsy-help-search-deck-name = Search Deck
whimsy-help-search-deck-text = Search Deck: flip through search results one by one in a Glance; Cmd+Enter keeps one as a tab
whimsy-help-already-open-name = Already Open
whimsy-help-already-open-text = Already open: typing an address that's open in another tab or space takes you there instead of opening a copy (Arc)
whimsy-help-trails-name = Trails
whimsy-help-trails-text = Trails: pages you went back from stay in the Back/Forward menu as branches, with where the tab came from
whimsy-help-page-actions-name = Page Actions
whimsy-help-page-actions-text = Page actions: add events to Calendar, open places in Maps, cook mode for recipes, from the page's own data (Safari Highlights)
whimsy-help-split-alt-click-name = Split Alt Click
whimsy-help-split-alt-click-text = Option+click a tab in the sidebar to open it in a split with the current tab (Arc)
whimsy-help-split-arc-keys-name = Split Arc Keys
whimsy-help-split-arc-keys-text = Arc's Split View commands: Add Split View (Ctrl+Shift+=), Close this Split Pane (Ctrl+Shift+-), Separate Page, Expand Current Split, Ctrl+Shift+1-4 and [ ] to move between panes
whimsy-help-command-bar-motion-name = Command Bar Motion
whimsy-help-command-bar-motion-text = Command bar: a quick, subtle open and close (160ms in, 110ms out; a plain fade with Reduce Motion)
whimsy-help-command-bar-ranking-name = Command Bar Ranking
whimsy-help-command-bar-ranking-text = One stable command ranking: exact, prefix, word-prefix, and other matches
whimsy-help-command-bar-dedup-name = Command Bar Dedup
whimsy-help-command-bar-dedup-text = Command bar: one row per page title on Figma, Notion, GitHub and Arc's other 7 hosts (Arc's dedupByTitleAndHost)
whimsy-help-arc-menus-name = Arc Menus
whimsy-help-arc-menus-text = Arc's menu bar: a Tabs menu, Arc's names (Hide Sidebar, Blank Window, New Space..., Undo Archive Tab), Show Toolbar, Reveal Tab in Sidebar, Capture in Portrait Mode, Help > Essential Keyboard Shortcuts
whimsy-help-archive-tab-menu-name = Archive Tab Menu
whimsy-help-archive-tab-menu-text = Tab menu in Arc's words: Archive Tab, Archive Tabs Below, Restore Last Closed Tab (closed tabs go to the Archive)
whimsy-help-do-not-disturb-name = Do Not Disturb
whimsy-help-do-not-disturb-text = Do Not Disturb: one command pauses site notifications until you turn it off or quit, and holds Whimsy's unprompted toasts
whimsy-help-paste-guard-name = Paste Guard
whimsy-help-paste-guard-text = Paste guard: asks before you paste something that looks like an API key, private key, card number or sign-in token into a web page
whimsy-help-teach-once-name = Teach Once
whimsy-help-teach-once-text = Teach once: one small hint the first time a shortcut or feature could help, then never again
whimsy-help-space-switch-queue-name = Space Switch Queue
whimsy-help-space-switch-queue-text = Space switches play one at a time (Arc): a switch asked for mid-slide waits for the slide to finish; swipes step, keys coalesce
whimsy-help-split-pane-menu-name = Split Pane Menu
whimsy-help-split-pane-menu-text = Split pane menu: a ⋯ button on each pane's header holds Arc's per-pane actions (Separate from Split View, Share, Mute, Copy Link, Copy link as Markdown, Archive Item); optionally always-visible headers like Arc's
whimsy-help-split-row-menu-name = Split Row Menu
whimsy-help-split-row-menu-text = Split row menu: right-clicking a split in the sidebar opens Arc's split menu (Share Split View, Separate All Tabs, Add Tab, Convert to Vertical/Horizontal, a submenu per pane, Change Icon, Rename, Duplicate, Move to, Archive)
whimsy-help-menu-prefs-name = Menu Prefs
whimsy-help-menu-prefs-text = Settings → Menus: turn any right-click menu item on or off (tab, link, page, selection, image, space, sidebar, folder and split menus)
whimsy-help-video-speech-captions-name = Video Speech Captions
whimsy-help-video-speech-captions-text = Live captions for videos without any: CC turns the video's speech into captions on your Mac, then translates them
whimsy-help-cast-name = Cast
whimsy-help-cast-text = Cast to AirPlay: send the page's video to an Apple TV or AirPlay screen (View > Cast...)
whimsy-help-move-to-new-space-name = Move To New Space
whimsy-help-move-to-new-space-text = Move to > New Space...: make a space and move the tab (or its whole split) into it (Arc)
whimsy-help-live-folders-resync-name = Live Folders Resync
whimsy-help-live-folders-resync-text = Resync live folder: bring back tabs closed by hand
whimsy-help-menu-parity-name = Menu Parity
whimsy-help-menu-parity-text = Right-click and command parity: every menu action is a command (no default shortcut), more commands as menu items (most off until turned on in Settings > Menus), Share submenu lists the share services
whimsy-help-battery-saver-name = Battery Saver
whimsy-help-battery-saver-text = Battery Saver: throttle frame rate (30fps) and background activity below 20% battery, with heads-up banner and auto-off when charged (Arc parity)
whimsy-help-adult-history-name = Adult History
whimsy-help-adult-history-text = Keep adult sites out of history: on-device list and self-labels; pages load, visits aren't kept
whimsy-help-form-protection-name = Form Protection
whimsy-help-form-protection-text = Form protection: tabs with half-filled forms are exempt from auto-archive and show a subtle indicator
whimsy-help-smart-buttons-name = Smart Buttons
whimsy-help-smart-buttons-text = Smart address bar buttons: Reader, Translate, media and Downloads in progress beside the address bar when relevant
whimsy-help-font-inspector-name = Font Inspector
whimsy-help-font-inspector-text = Font Inspector: What Font Is This? Popover with rendered font, size, weight, line-height, spacing, and colour
whimsy-help-element-inspector-name = Element Inspector
whimsy-help-element-inspector-text = Element Inspector lite: box model, colours, contrast ratio, gap measurement, and Open in DevTools
whimsy-help-page-dev-name = Page Dev
whimsy-help-page-dev-text = Page developer tools: Fonts on This Page, Page Colors (palette and contrast) and Built With (tech stack), in Tools > Browser Tools
whimsy-help-site-popup-chrome-name = Site Popup Chrome
whimsy-help-site-popup-chrome-text = Sign-in popups show their address: a site's popup window keeps Firefox's read-only address bar and identity
whimsy-help-site-settings-name = Site Settings
whimsy-help-site-settings-text = Site settings: the site panel remembers a site's zoom, autoplay, Reader View, full screen and user agent, and forgets them one by one or all at once
whimsy-help-view-source-wrap-name = View Source Wrap
whimsy-help-view-source-wrap-text = View Page Source line wrap option and command
whimsy-help-mini-tabs-name = Mini Tabs
whimsy-help-mini-tabs-text = Mini Whimsy tabs: pill tabs from the second page, sign-in popups as tabs, links from other apps join the open Mini, Cmd+O moves every page
whimsy-help-settings-commands-name = Settings Commands
whimsy-help-settings-commands-text = Every setting is a command: turn any Whimsy setting on or off (or pick its choice) from the command bar or a shortcut, and find it in Settings by its name
whimsy-help-press-again-name = Press Again
whimsy-help-press-again-text = Press again: when a page uses a browser shortcut (⌘S, ⇧⌘C, ...) the page gets the first press and a second press in a row runs the browser's command (Arc)
whimsy-help-space-edges-name = Space Edges
whimsy-help-space-edges-text = Space edges (Arc): Next Space past the last space opens New Space; Previous Space stops at the first
whimsy-help-private-move-name = Private Move
whimsy-help-private-move-text = Move out of private: Move To in a private window, and Move Out of Private… on a private tab, reopen the pages in a space you pick, after asking
whimsy-help-private-lock-name = Private Lock
whimsy-help-private-lock-text = Private lock: private tabs, the Private Space and private windows hide behind Touch ID or your Mac password when you step away
whimsy-help-call-controls-name = Call Controls
whimsy-help-call-controls-text = Call controls: the small player and picture-in-picture toggle a Meet call's own microphone and camera, in sync with the page
whimsy-help-ai-chat-name = AI Chat
whimsy-help-ai-chat-text = AI chat: ⌘E opens a chat about this tab beside the page, per tab, kept on this Mac
whimsy-help-ai-ask-name = AI Ask
whimsy-help-ai-ask-text = Ask AI in the command bar: type a question, press ⌘↩, the answer shows under the bar
whimsy-help-ai-updates-name = AI Updates
whimsy-help-ai-updates-text = Updates in the command bar: routine, watch, research, and agent results at the top, with Remind me and Dismiss
whimsy-help-ai-context-commands-name = AI Context Commands
whimsy-help-ai-context-commands-text = ⌘K knows the page: AI commands for what's on screen (summarize, translate, ask)
whimsy-help-ai-selection-commands-name = AI Selection Commands
whimsy-help-ai-selection-commands-text = AI on selected text: right-click rows and a result card
whimsy-help-ai-commands-name = AI Commands
whimsy-help-ai-commands-text = Commands: saved prompts you run from ⌘K, right-click, and the command bar
whimsy-help-ai-related-name = AI Related
whimsy-help-ai-related-text = Related results: the command bar finds pages by meaning from an on-device index
whimsy-help-ai-memory-name = AI Memory
whimsy-help-ai-memory-text = Memory: stable facts about you, saved automatically with Undo, used in answers
whimsy-help-ai-style-name = AI Style
whimsy-help-ai-style-text = How AI writes: your tone and style for every AI answer, plus your preferred language
whimsy-help-ai-agent-name = AI Agent
whimsy-help-ai-agent-text = Agent: Drive (every step in your tabs) or Background, with pauses before anything risky
whimsy-help-ai-agent-save-pdf-name = AI Agent Save Pdf
whimsy-help-ai-agent-save-pdf-text = Agent saves a page as a PDF in Downloads, after you approve
whimsy-help-ai-task-folder-name = AI Task Folder
whimsy-help-ai-task-folder-text = Task folders: an agent's tabs sit in their own unpinned folder that dissolves when done
whimsy-help-ai-outside-agents-name = AI Outside Agents
whimsy-help-ai-outside-agents-text = Outside agents: Claude Code and other apps work in your tabs through Whimsy's connector, under the same rules
whimsy-help-ai-activity-name = AI Activity
whimsy-help-ai-activity-text = Activity: a local record of what agents did, cleared by the Fire button
whimsy-help-ai-connectors-name = AI Connectors
whimsy-help-ai-connectors-text = Connectors: Google, Microsoft, Apple Calendar, Granola, Linear, Jira, and MCP servers as AI context
whimsy-help-ai-onboarding-name = AI Onboarding
whimsy-help-ai-onboarding-text = AI onboarding: connect a model, then connectors, then a short celebration
whimsy-help-ai-hints-name = AI Hints
whimsy-help-ai-hints-text = AI hints: one toast per surface, once ever, three a day, never a halo
whimsy-help-ai-summary-name = AI Summary
whimsy-help-ai-summary-text = Page summary: a summary with passage chips, for long pages and PDFs too
whimsy-help-ai-draft-reply-name = AI Draft Reply
whimsy-help-ai-draft-reply-text = Draft reply: AI drafts a reply in the field you're writing in
whimsy-help-ai-form-fill-name = AI Form Fill
whimsy-help-ai-form-fill-text = Form fill: AI fills a form from what you tell it, never card, password, or code fields
whimsy-help-ai-translate-name = AI Translate
whimsy-help-ai-translate-text = Translate with AI: pick the page's language or yours, and translate a selection in place
whimsy-help-ai-page-edits-name = AI Page Edits
whimsy-help-ai-page-edits-text = Page edits by description: change a page's look in words, kept as a Boost or a zap
whimsy-help-ai-scam-warning-name = AI Scam Warning
whimsy-help-ai-scam-warning-text = Scam warning: a calm bar when a page looks like a scam, with what looks off
whimsy-help-ai-compare-name = AI Compare
whimsy-help-ai-compare-text = Compare: true prices across stores, read in a hidden reader
whimsy-help-ai-tab-requests-name = AI Tab Requests
whimsy-help-ai-tab-requests-text = Tab requests: ask chat to open, close, group, or find tabs
whimsy-help-find-card-name = Find Card
whimsy-help-find-card-text = Find as a floating card at the top right, with Ask
whimsy-help-double-escape-name = Double Escape
whimsy-help-double-escape-text = Press Esc twice to leave a page's full screen
whimsy-help-pass-keys-to-page-name = Pass Keys To Page
whimsy-help-pass-keys-to-page-text = Pass Keys to Page: a command that gives the current tab's page every key, ⌘T and ⌘W too, until you hold Esc or switch tabs
whimsy-help-ai-video-summary-name = AI Video Summary
whimsy-help-ai-video-summary-text = Summarize a video: summary, chapters, and transcript in chat; timestamps jump the video
whimsy-help-video-speed-range-name = Video Speed Range
whimsy-help-video-speed-range-text = Video speed from 1/16× to 16×
whimsy-help-video-default-speed-name = Video Default Speed
whimsy-help-video-default-speed-text = Back to default speed: one press returns a video to your usual speed
whimsy-help-image-text-name = Image Text
whimsy-help-image-text-text = Text in images: select, copy, and find text in images, recognized on this Mac
whimsy-help-read-aloud-name = Read Aloud
whimsy-help-read-aloud-text = Read aloud: listen to a page with a mini player, on this Mac
whimsy-help-dictation-name = Dictation
whimsy-help-dictation-text = Dictation: hold Fn to dictate into the focused field, on this Mac
whimsy-help-media-settings-name = Media Settings
whimsy-help-media-settings-text = Settings › Media: speed, captions, summaries, read aloud, and dictation in one page
whimsy-help-routines-name = Routines
whimsy-help-routines-text = Routines: AI runs on a schedule or a trigger and leaves results in Updates and a thread
whimsy-help-ambient-audio-name = Ambient Audio
whimsy-help-ambient-audio-text = Ambient sound: six bundled loops (rain, cafe, woods, fireplace, ocean, brown noise) via ⌘K, played from the chrome window
whimsy-help-command-bar-numbers-name = Command Bar Numbers
whimsy-help-command-bar-numbers-text = ⌘1–⌘9 pick a row while the command bar is open; hold ⌘ to see the numbers
whimsy-help-command-bar-vpn-strip-name = Command Bar VPN Strip
whimsy-help-command-bar-vpn-strip-text = VPN status strip along the bottom of the command bar's results while the VPN is on
whimsy-help-annotations-name = Annotations
whimsy-help-annotations-text = Annotations: highlight passages in four colors and keep a note on any page
whimsy-help-meeting-notes-name = Meeting Notes
whimsy-help-meeting-notes-text = Meeting notes: Granola's key points in chat during calendar meetings, or Whimsy's own notes when Granola can't help
whimsy-help-hover-cards-name = Hover Cards
whimsy-help-hover-cards-text = Hover cards: rest on a tab or a link to see a picture, its title and address, and an AI description
whimsy-help-passkeys-name = Passkeys
whimsy-help-passkeys-text = Passkeys with Touch ID, held by Whimsy in the Secure Enclave
whimsy-help-totp-name = TOTP
whimsy-help-totp-text = Verification codes: keep a site's authenticator codes and fill them with a click
whimsy-help-restart-command-name = Restart Command
whimsy-help-restart-command-text = Restart Whimsy: a command that quits and reopens with every window and tab restored
whimsy-help-page-animations-command-name = Page Animations Command
whimsy-help-page-animations-command-text = Turn Off Page Animations: a command that stops CSS animations and transitions on the current tab until it reloads
whimsy-help-page-minimap-name = Page Minimap
whimsy-help-page-minimap-text = Page Minimap: a live picture of a long page at its right edge with the view outlined; click to jump, drag to scroll
whimsy-help-window-title-space-name = Window Title Space
whimsy-help-window-title-space-text = Show space name in window title: "<space> — <page title>" (Settings → Tab Management, off by default)
whimsy-help-focus-sessions-name = Focus Sessions
whimsy-help-focus-sessions-text = Focus sessions: a dial to set the length, a countdown in the page's corner, distracting sites paused, and confetti at the end
whimsy-help-side-panels-name = Side Panels
whimsy-help-side-panels-text = Side panels: Essentials open in a resizable popover next to the sidebar (Open in Side Panel), chat can too
whimsy-help-window-on-top-name = Window On Top
whimsy-help-window-on-top-text = Keep Window on Top: float every Whimsy window above other apps' windows (Settings → Look and Feel, macOS, off by default)
whimsy-help-open-in-browser-name = Open In Browser
whimsy-help-open-in-browser-text = Open in Safari / Open in Chrome: hands the current tab's address to another installed browser
whimsy-help-photo-metadata-name = Photo Metadata
whimsy-help-photo-metadata-text = Remove location and camera details (Exif, GPS, XMP, and text) from JPEG and PNG photos you upload, losslessly
whimsy-help-local-plugins-name = Local Plugins
whimsy-help-local-plugins-text = Local plugins: your own unsigned extensions, one folder each in the profile's whimsy-plugins folder, approved before they run
whimsy-help-safety-check-name = Safety Check
whimsy-help-safety-check-text = Safety Check: a Settings card that checks for updates, breached passwords, risky extensions and unused site permissions
whimsy-help-search-with-name = Search With
whimsy-help-search-with-text = Search With: a submenu after the selection's search row listing your other engines, each opening the selection like the row above
whimsy-help-webkit-tabs-name = WebKit Tabs
whimsy-help-webkit-tabs-text = WebKit tabs: open a tab or a site in macOS WebKit from ⌘K or the site panel, with a WebKit pill in the address bar
whimsy-help-svg-save-name = Save SVG as Image
whimsy-help-svg-save-text = Save SVG as image: Save Image As on an SVG image or an inline SVG saves it as SVG, PNG, or JPG, on a clear, white, or page-coloured background, at the size you pick
whimsy-help-webkit-drm-name = WebKit for Protected Video
whimsy-help-webkit-drm-text = WebKit for protected video: a site that asks for Widevine switches its tab to WebKit, which plays it with FairPlay, and keeps you signed in
